  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "eeCLOUD 4.2.1 fixes paginated reads on clustered memories.\n\nHighlights in this release:\n- Fixed the duplicate page/entry multiplication that produced incorrect offsets in the base ReadAllData overload.\n- Clustered reads now retrieve only the records selected by the globally paginated parent memory instead of scanning entire physical clusters.\n- Preserved global ASC/DESC ordering and addresses when a page spans multiple clusters.\n- Added batched index lookup support for PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, SFTP and eeCACHE.\n- Added a V4 regression scenario covering consecutive pages, cluster boundaries, ordering, duplicates and skipped records.",
